	(text "AUX POWER + BRAKE OUTPUT (Brakes sheet v2)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20 0)
		(effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "0f71d588-7f6c-5aa0-bb3d-377620a9315d")
	)
	(text "+24V: LM70880 synchronous buck, 500 kHz (RT 43.2k), 24.0 V (0.8 V x (1 + 348k/12k)), 6 A continuous / 8 A short-term. Peak current limit 56 mV / 5 mOhm R538 = 10.0-12.4 A (cycle by cycle); hiccup when FB < 0.4 V for 512 limited cycles (off 16384 cycles = 33 ms, 2.8 ms soft start)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 27 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "65695c06-a3a0-55f4-a066-90b6a5d7945d")
	)
	(text "UVLO 27.7 V on / 24.9 V off (267k/10k). FPWM (PFM = GND), spread spectrum on (CONFIG 41.2k), BIAS = GND (immune to v1.2 back-feed; VCC from VIN). Ext. comp 4.42k + 15nF // 100pF (fc ~25 kHz). PG not used. Powers the v1.2 board (J510) and the brake output (via D523)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 32 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "1ccb1637-4ad5-505a-a58f-387f41700555")
	)
	(text "Kelvin: ISNS+ (pin 11) and VOUT (pin 12) from the inner pad edges of R538; R538 sits next to L520 pad 2. R539 1R in series with CBOOT (required, VCC = 8 V with an adjustable output)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 200 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "9f412d6b-66cb-5249-ba2f-bb1cb06a7d9f")
	)
	(text "BRAKE OUTPUT: DRV8874 PWM mode (PMODE high). IN1/IN2 = BRAKE1_EN/BRAKE2_EN (STM32 PE5/PE6 = TIM9 CH1/CH2): 00 coast, 10 OUT1+ (coil brake: RELEASED), 01 reverse (actuator), 11 brake."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 215 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "e99433ea-9824-5190-ac23-9e68db1af1ef")
	)
	(text "J501: both brakes in parallel (1-2 brake A, 3-4 brake B). Coil brake: OUT1 = +, never drive 01 if the coil has a built-in diode. Supply: +24V through D523 (blocks coil energy from the rail); D522 clamps VM_BRK."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 220 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "88e9de6b-ad37-596a-b084-6c4507f248a7")
	)
	(text "ITRIP = VREF / (RIPROPI x 450 uA/A) = 3.0 V / (2.2k x 450u) = 3.0 A, fixed off-time (IMODE GND). ~1.5-2 A continuous (0.2 Ohm). nSLEEP via JP501: 1-2 (default) = E-stop immediate (coil brakes), 2-3 = DRV_EN_DLY (actuators get ~1.7 s to apply)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 225 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "94ef6717-3373-5f44-95ff-d84a17dc9255")
	)
	(text "R507: ESTOP_SENSE reads +3V3_DRV_EN on an STM32 input (PD10). BRK_FLT_N (DRV8874 nFAULT, OC / thermal / UVLO, R510 pull-up) -> STM32 PD9 (input, 2026-10-24)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 250 270 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "f91213cd-02ef-5a01-bb38-3709e9b4ed93")
	)
